5619:Core/Src/littlefs/lfs.c ****         }
5620:Core/Src/littlefs/lfs.c **** 
5621:Core/Src/littlefs/lfs.c ****         return 0;
5622:Core/Src/littlefs/lfs.c ****     }
5623:Core/Src/littlefs/lfs.c **** 
